A NOTE ON THE FUTURE GPL PLAN
-----------------------------
README.md and CLAUDE.md record a locked decision to embed Stockfish, which is GPLv3, and
to publish this app's source openly as a result. That decision has not been carried out:
there is no Stockfish, no NNUE and no GPL code anywhere in this repository today, and the
engine that ships is original work (Sources/BiyaherongCoachCore/LocalEngine.swift).

This file therefore describes what actually ships now. When Stockfish lands, GPLv3 §5
requires the combined work to be licensed under the GPL, and this file must be replaced
with the GPL text at that time — not before, because a licence grant is irrevocable and
cannot be un-given once published.
